# SDD scratch workspace (ledger, briefs, review packages)
.superpowers/

# Reviewer transcripts and one-off prompts. Ephemeral by design: the codex
# transcript for one review ran to 4,460 lines of tool traffic, and it was
# staged for commit once before anyone noticed. Findings worth keeping go in
# the change's verify.md.
tmp/
